abstract: "Exploratory, pre-registered test of whether basal water pressure and uplift change before glacier acceleration at Langhovde Glacier, East Antarctica (one event, January 2022). It uses the Sugiyama et al. (2026) deposit and raw 1 s GNSS, air pressure and borehole accelerometer data from the NIPR Arctic Data archive System. The result is inconclusive. The research question was proposed by an external researcher. The code was developed by the author with an AI coding agent."
